      "t": "html",
      "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> operator!= <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_00785\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_00785]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00130\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00130</a></span></h3>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;typename T, typename E&gt; bool operator!= (const T &amp;lhs, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">Result</a>&lt; T, E &gt; &amp;rhs);</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Compare a Result instance for inequality to a value. A Result that contains no value is unequal to every value. A Result is equal to a value only if the Result contains a value of the same type, and the values compare equal.</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n\n"
    },
